    "[Translate to English:] Arriver à Strasbourg en avion ou - International Welcome e-desk - University of Strasbourg\nShare the page :\nAdd the page to your favorites :\nPage has been added to favorites\nPage has been removed from favorites\nBy Plane or Train\nStrasbourg's central location puts it within easy reach of other major cities: just a few hours from Paris, Lyon and the major German cities.\nStrasbourg has excellent motorway, air and rail links.\nYou can get regular flights to Strasbourg Airport from around 40 different places, like Amsterdam, Bordeaux, Brussels, Budapest, Lisbon, London, Lyon, Madrid, Marseille, Montpellier, Nantes, Nice, Rennes, and Toulouse.\nThe airport is about 10 kilometers away from the center of Strasbourg. Taxis are available there until 11 pm, which is when the last flight arrives.\nIf you want an affordable option to get to the Strasbourg train station quickly, you can take the TER shuttle. It only takes about 9 minutes, and it runs about 4 times per hour. The cost is €3.20 (\ninformation\n)\nRoute de Strasbourg, 67960 Entzheim\n03 88 64 67 67\ninformation(@)strasbourg.aeroport(.)fr\nwww.strasbourg.aeroport.fr\n130 km away from Strasbourg\nB.P. 120, 68304 SAINT-LOUIS CEDEX\n03 89 90 31 11\nwww.euroairport.com\n490 km away from Strasbourg, or a 1h45 en TGV-ride.\n291 boulevard Raspail, 75675 PARIS CEDEX 14\n08 92 68 15 15\nwww.aeroportsdeparis.fr\n58 km away from Strasbourg\nBaden-Airpark GmbH  – Flughafen Karlsruhe / Baden-Baden Victoria Boulevard A 106 D-77836 RHEINMÜNSTER\n(49) 72 29 66 2000\ninfo(@)badenairpark(.)de\nwww.baden-airpark.de\n210 km away from Strasbourg\nFraport AG  – Frankfurt Airport Services Worldwide D-60547 FRANKFURT/MAIN\nwww.airportcity-frankfurt.de\nThe Strasbourg TGV train station is located a few minutes away from downtown Strasbourg.\nThere you will find several\ntram and bus lines, as well as taxis.\nhttps://www.sncf-connect.com/\nStrasbourg\n—\nKarlsruhe: 45mn\nStrasbourg\n—\nParis: 1:45\nStrasbourg\n—\nDijon: 2:10\nStrasbourg\n—\nLille: 3:00\nStrasbourg\n—\nLyon: 3:50\nStrasbourg\n—\nBruxelles: 4:00\nStrasbourg\n—\nMunich: 4:00\nStrasbourg\n—\nRennes: 4:15\nStrasbourg\n—\nNantes: 5:00\nStrasbourg\n—\nBordeaux: 5:30\nStrasbourg\n—\nMarseille: 5:30\nStrasbourg\n—\nAmsterdam: 6:00\nStrasbourg\n—\nLondres: 6:15\nStrasbourg\n—\nBerlin: 7:00\nMenu\nBrowse those links to navigate the website\nDisplay\nHide\nthe searchbox\nFill in your search :\nLaunch search\nClose\nOur audiences :\nStudent Profile\nResearcher Profile\nI think about it\nBefore\nmy arrival\nI am\nin\nStrasbourg\nBefore\nmy departure\nServices Pack"
